### Stock for a known SKU
GET http://localhost:5001/stock/SKU-COFFEE

### Stock for an unknown SKU -> 404
GET http://localhost:5001/stock/SKU-NOPE

### Place an order -> 201
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-COFFEE", "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "SKU-MUG", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Unknown SKU -> 400
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-NOPE", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Insufficient stock, only 3 grinders are seeded -> 409
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-GRINDER", "quantity": 10 }
  ]
}

### Above the 50000 cent credit limit -> 402
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-COFFEE", "quantity": 100 }
  ]
}

### Read an order back, paste an id from a 201 response above
GET http://localhost:5000/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
